sportsbook(slip): fcbet216 redesign + fix stake input breaking on type

- Root cause of "input broke when typing": sbUpdateBetStake,
  sbNumpadKey, sbCombiQuickStake etc. called renderBetSlip() on
  every keystroke, destroying the focused input. New patchSlipFinancials()
  updates Gagner / summary totals via DOM without full re-render.
- Bet slip visual redesign to match fcbet216 reference:
    • Tabs: active tab on rgb(49,49,49) pill background
    • Bet cards: rounded rgb(49,49,49) boxes with 10px margin
    • Stake input: 96×40px visible box, green border on focus
    • Promo + Tout effacer: bordered rounded boxes with padding
    • Combiné cards: warm tint; Système rows in rounded boxes
- Stake input changed from type=number to type=text inputmode=decimal
  (no spinner arrows, no browser reformat on each keypress).
- Numpad/quick-stakes hidden by default; shown on mobile only when
  stake input is focused (.slip-stake-editor--open). Desktop uses
  direct keyboard input only — matches fcbet216 desktop reference.
- Inline critical CSS in index.php so Bootstrap cannot override slip
  padding, card margins, or green CTA button.
- Bump build stamp to b20260525ch.
